vczh Coda plugin

Derived from shared workflow prompts and selected guideline excerpts in
vczh-libraries/Tools, Copilot/, by vczh and contributors, at commit
493f3fe00b4a48831c1cc0612184fde709bafcb2.

Upstream: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/Tools
Licensing statement: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/License/blob/master/README.md

Modifications: classify guideline excerpts by dimension and topic; retain only
general and C++ conventions; remove library-specific examples and toolchain
requirements; remove corresponding prerequisites from shared workflow context;
replace host entry points. Original and distributed hashes and protocol edits
are recorded in upstream/manifest.json. Convention excerpts carry source ranges,
edit markers and hashes in prompts/general.json and prompts/cpp.json.

Chinese navigation labels, project prompt management, the cross-platform archive
helper, and Coda workflow/panel integration are host features, not upstream ones.

This plugin is not an official vczh project or an endorsement by the authors.
The reference repositories' product code and project knowledge bodies are not
distributed with this plugin.

